      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "未来现金流也会承压。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 三、非现金损益与利润构成\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "折旧、摊销、资产减值准备、股份支付等非付现成本会"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "减少净利润但不流出现金，编制间接法时需加回，通常"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "使经营现金流**高于**净利润。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "因此单靠折旧无法解释“净利增、现金流降”。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "真正会推高利润却不带来经营现金流入的，是以下几类"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "：\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **非现金收益占比上升**：资产减值转回、公允价值"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "变动收益等计入利润但不产生现金。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **非经营损益**：投资收益、处置长期资产损益"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "的现金流入归入投资活动（或根本未实现），间接法下"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "需从净利润中扣除，这类收益占比越高，缺口越大。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **递延所得税、汇兑损益**：影响利润但不对"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "应当期经营现金收付。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **利润结构变化**：主业毛利率上升但以放宽"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "账期换取收入，会同时推高利润和应收。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 四、现金流分类口径与一次性因素\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "同一笔现金记入哪一类活动，也会改变经营现金流的表现"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "：\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **票据贴现与应收账款保理**：若终止确认并按"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "经营活动列报，经营现金流增加；若作为质押借款或未"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "终止确认，现金流入计入筹资活动，经营现金流不变而"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "筹资现金流增加，等于压低了经营现金流。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **供应链金融/反向保理**：由银行代付应付"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "账款，可能把原本属于经营活动的付款重分类为筹资活动"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **利息与税费归类**：利息支出通常列入筹资"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "活动、利息收入列入投资活动，财务费用不减少经营现金流"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "；准则允许一定政策选择，影响跨期和跨主体可比性。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **一次性因素**：大额预收款集中确认收入、"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "政府补助、资产处置、税收返还等，会阶段性扭曲利润"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "与现金流的关系。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 五、如何定位具体原因\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 指标 | 计算 | 解读 |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "|---|---|---|\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 收现比 | 销售商品、提供劳务收到的现金 ÷"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " 营业收入 | 持续低于 1 且下降，说明回款质量"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "恶化；需注意含税口径与票据结算影响 |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 净现比 | 经营活动现金流净额 ÷ 净利润 |"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " 长期显著低于 1 需警惕；若因折旧摊销大而低于"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " 1 属正常，应结合间接法判断 |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 应收账款周转率/天数 | 收入 ÷ 平均应收账款"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " | 周转天数拉长、应收增速持续高于收入增速，是"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "收入质量弱化的先行信号 |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 存货周转率/天数 | 营业成本 ÷ 平均存货"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " | 天数上升说明备货或滞销，占用经营现金 |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 应付周转天数 | 应付账款 ÷ 营业成本 ×"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " 天数 | 异常拉长可能靠占用供应商资金维持现金流"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": " |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 合同负债/预收变动 | 期末减期初 | 由正"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "转负说明前期预收红利消失 |\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "| 利润构成 | 投资收益、公允价值变动、处置收益"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "占利润总额比重 | 占比上升说明利润的非现金、非"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "经营性成分增加 |\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "最直接的工具是**现金流量表补充资料（间接法调节"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "表）**，它把净利润逐项调节为经营现金流，可清晰"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "拆分出资产减值、折旧摊销、投资收益、经营性应收增加"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "、存货增加、经营性应付增加各占多少，从而定位具体"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "原因。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "分析应看多期趋势与结构，而非单期数据。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "## 六、结论\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "净利润增长而经营现金流下降，本身是两套确认口径差异"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "的正常表现，常见于快速扩张、账期放宽、备货增加，"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "或利润中非现金、非经营收益占比上升的企业，**不"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "必然意味着财务造假**。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "但若同时出现收现比与净现比持续走低、应收和存货增速"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "长期高于收入增速、利润高度依赖投资收益或公允价值"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "变动、现金流依赖票据贴现与保理维持，则需警惕收入"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "确认激进、回款风险上升与盈利质量问题。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "判断应结合间接法调节表、多期趋势与同业对比，而非"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "依赖单一指标。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_e9610c0e9dcb40079a2855aaed52e039",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "> 说明：以上为一般财务与会计原理层面的解释，未"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
